'''Season twenty-three''' of ''[[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)|Dancing with the Stars]]'' premiered on September 12, 2016, on the [[American Broadcasting Company|ABC]] network.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.people.com/article/dancing-stars-season-23-key-art|title=First Look: Sharna Burgess and Artem Chigvintsev Go with the Flow for Dancing with the Stars Season 23|last=Gomez|first=Patrick|work=[[People (magazine)|People]]|date=August 11, 2016|access-date=August 24, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160815043357/http://www.people.com/article/dancing-stars-season-23-key-art|archive-date=August 15, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref>

On November 22, 2016, Olympic gymnast [[Laurie Hernandez]], made history as the youngest winner in the show's history, at age 16, and she was partnered with [[Valentin Chmerkovskiy]]. [[IndyCar]] driver [[James Hinchcliffe]] and [[Sharna Burgess]] finished in second place, and [[Detroit Lions]] wide receiver [[Calvin Johnson Jr.]] and [[Lindsay Arnold]] finished third.

==Cast==

===Couples===
This season featured thirteen celebrity contestants. The first eight professional dancers were revealed on ''[[Good Morning America]]'' on August 23, 2016: [[Lindsay Arnold]], [[Sharna Burgess]], [[Witney Carson]], [[Artem Chigvintsev]], [[Val Chmerkovskiy]], [[Sasha Farber]], [[Allison Holker]], and [[Gleb Savchenko]].<ref name="GMApro">{{Cite web|url=http://www.people.com/article/dancing-stars-season-23-pros-kym-johnson-not-returning|title=Dancing with the Stars: Season 23 Pro Dancers Revealed|last=Gomez|first=Patrick|work=People|date=August 23, 2016|access-date=August 24, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160824142358/http://www.people.com/article/dancing-stars-season-23-pros-kym-johnson-not-returning|archive-date=August 24, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref> The other returning dancers were later announced: [[Emma Slater]],<ref>{{cite web|author=DancingABC|title=Twitter / @DancingABC: Look who's back as a pro this season on #DWTS! |url=https://twitter.com/DancingABC/status/768533217532141568|work=Twitter |date=August 24, 2016|access-date=August 24, 2016}}</ref> [[Maksim Chmerkovskiy]],<ref>{{cite web |url=http://tvline.com/2016/08/25/dancing-with-the-stars-pro-maksim-chmerkovskiy-returning-season-23/ |title=''DWTS'' Pro Maksim Chmerkovskiy Returning for Season 23 |last=Schwartz |first=Ryan |work=TVLine |date=August 25, 2016 |access-date=August 25, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160826005241/http://tvline.com/2016/08/25/dancing-with-the-stars-pro-maksim-chmerkovskiy-returning-season-23/ |archive-date=August 26, 2016 |url-status=dead }}</ref> [[Derek Hough]], and [[Cheryl Burke]].<ref name="hough" /> [[Jenna Johnson (dancer)|Jenna Johnson]] was the only new pro this season, having previously been a member of the troupe.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/DancingABC/status/768885681473085440|title=Twitter / @DancingABC: Hooray! Former troupe member @Dance10Jenna will be a #DWTS pro for the first time.|work=Twitter|author=DancingABC|date=August 25, 2016|access-date=August 25, 2016|archive-date=December 6, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221206084604/https://twitter.com/DancingABC/status/768885681473085440|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.buddytv.com/articles/dancing-with-the-stars/maksim-chmerkovskiy-and-emma-s-61060.aspx|title=Maksim Chmerkovskiy and Emma Slater Return as Pros for 'Dancing with the Stars' Season 23|last=Kubicek|first=John|date=August 25, 2016|access-date=August 28, 2016|publisher=BuddyTV|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160828053337/http://www.buddytv.com/articles/dancing-with-the-stars/maksim-chmerkovskiy-and-emma-s-61060.aspx|archive-date=August 28, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref>

The full cast was revealed on August 30, 2016, on ''Good Morning America''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://gma.yahoo.com/dwts-2016-celebrity-cast-revealed-ryan-lochte-amber-123029354--abc-news-tv.html|title=''DWTS'' 2016 Celebrity Cast Revealed: Ryan Lochte, Amber Rose, Rick Perry Among Star Lineup|work=[[Good Morning America]]|access-date=August 30, 2016|date=August 30, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160830144906/https://gma.yahoo.com/dwts-2016-celebrity-cast-revealed-ryan-lochte-amber-123029354--abc-news-tv.html|archive-date=August 30, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref>

