===Hosts and judges===
[[Tom Bergeron]] and [[Erin Andrews]] returned as hosts, and [[Carrie Ann Inaba]], [[Len Goodman]], and [[Bruno Tonioli]] returned as judges.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://abc.go.com/shows/dancing-with-the-stars/about-the-show |title=About Dancing with the Stars |website=abc.go.com |access-date=August 31, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180316040627/http://abc.go.com/shows/dancing-with-the-stars/about-the-show |archive-date=March 16, 2018 |url-status=live }}</ref> On August 26, 2016, it was reported that [[Julianne Hough]] would return to the show as a judge following a one-season hiatus.<ref name="hough">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2016/08/dancing-with-the-stars-season-23-return-pros-julianne-hough-derek-hough-maksim-chmerkovskiy-1201809677/|title='Dancing With The Stars' Season 23 Will See Return Of Pros Julianne & Derek Hough, Maksim Chmerkovskiy|last=Petski|first=Denise|date=August 26, 2016|access-date=August 28, 2016|publisher=Deadline|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160827175915/http://deadline.com/2016/08/dancing-with-the-stars-season-23-return-pros-julianne-hough-derek-hough-maksim-chmerkovskiy-1201809677/|archive-date=August 27, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref> Due to a personal tragedy, Erin Andrews took a week off from her co-hosting duties and former pro [[Kym Johnson|Kym Johnson-Herjavec]] filled in during the results show in week 3.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.eonline.com/news/797748/kym-johnson-to-fill-in-for-erin-andrews-as-dancing-with-the-stars-co-host|title=Kym Johnson to Fill in For Erin Andrews on DWTS|work=eonline.com|date=September 26, 2016 |access-date=September 26, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160927151901/http://www.eonline.com/news/797748/kym-johnson-to-fill-in-for-erin-andrews-as-dancing-with-the-stars-co-host|archive-date=September 27, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref> On October 17, [[Pitbull (rapper)|Pitbull]] took over Len Goodman's position as a guest judge for week 6.<ref name="week6">{{Cite magazine|last=Maggie|first=Fremont|url=https://ew.com/recap/dancing-with-the-stars-season-23-episode-9/|title=''Dancing With the Stars'' recap: Season 23, Episode 9|date=2016-10-18|access-date=2024-05-19|magazine=[[Entertainment Weekly]]|language=en-US|url-status=live|archive-date=May 19, 2024|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240519083107/https://ew.com/recap/dancing-with-the-stars-season-23-episode-9/}}</ref> On November 7, [[Idina Menzel]] took over for Goodman as a guest judge for week 9.<ref name="Showstoppers">{{cite web|url=http://www.broadwayworld.com/bwwtv/article/Scoop-DANCING-WITH-THE-STARS-on-ABC-Monday-November-7-2016-20161102|title=Scoop: DANCING WITH THE STARS on ABC – Monday, November 7, 2016|work=broadwayworld.com|date=November 2, 2016|access-date=November 2, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161104014600/http://www.broadwayworld.com/bwwtv/article/Scoop-DANCING-WITH-THE-STARS-on-ABC-Monday-November-7-2016-20161102|archive-date=November 4, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref>

=== Dance troupe ===
The troupe consisted of returning members [[Alan Bersten]], Brittany Cherry, [[Hayley Erbert]], and Dennis Jauch, joined by former pro [[Keo Motsepe]] and new member [[Britt Stewart]].<ref>{{cite web |title=George Pennacchio on Twitter |url=https://twitter.com/abc7george/status/769347992688037888 |access-date=September 3, 2016 |work=twitter.com |archive-date=November 25, 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221125182028/https://twitter.com/abc7george/status/769347992688037888 |url-status=live }}</ref>

